> One of these two (I have no way to guess which) may be {mi djuno
> ledu'u do djuno ledu'u makau klama}, but the other ...

The latter.  The former is "mi djuno ledu'u do djuno ledu'u makauxire klama",
on the analogy of:

	le mlatu poi viska le ratcu poi ke'a batci ke'axire
	the cat such-that ( -- saw the rat such-that (it [the rat] bit it [the cat])

